WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.059
"I'm here, Captain!" Ringo huffed.

2
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:12.980
Bot rolled in behind him.

3
00:00:12.981 --> 00:00:20.846
Clang! A screw fell off.

4
00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:23.766
Captain Nova frowned.

5
00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:27.416
"You two are in bad shape."

6
00:00:27.417 --> 00:00:30.849
"What's up, Captain?" Ringo asked.

7
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.632
"You have a new mission," she said.

8
00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:38.444
Ringo grinned. "I'm ready!"

9
00:00:38.445 --> 00:00:47.266
"This is a dangerous mission," Captain Nova said.

10
00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:50.324
"Two clamor birds are trapped.

11
00:00:50.325 --> 00:00:52.669
They're on Volcano Planet.

12
00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:57.382
And Mount Magma is about to explode."

13
00:00:57.383 --> 00:01:01.769
"Where's Mount Magma?" Ringo asked.

14
00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.901
Bing! Bot lit up a map.

15
00:01:04.902 --> 00:01:08.871
"Mount Magma is near Fire Lake."

16
00:01:08.872 --> 00:01:11.094
Captain Nova went on.

17
00:01:11.095 --> 00:01:13.045
"Your mission is to go there.

18
00:01:13.046 --> 00:01:16.718
You must rescue those noisy birds."

19
00:01:16.719 --> 00:01:20.836
"Why can't the birds just fly away?" Ringo asked.

20
00:01:20.837 --> 00:01:25.296
"They're too big to fly far," Bot said.

21
00:01:25.297 --> 00:01:29.434
"And they like Volcano's boomberries."

22
00:01:29.435 --> 00:01:31.883
Captain Nova rolled her eyes.

23
00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:34.485
"They're not very smart either.

24
00:01:34.486 --> 00:01:36.703
But no more questions.

25
00:01:36.704 --> 00:01:41.246
I have to get back to work."

26
00:01:41.247 --> 00:01:44.827
"Um, just one more question," Ringo said.

27
00:01:44.828 --> 00:01:49.079
"How soon will the volcano explode?"

28
00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:58.434
"Soon!" Captain Nova said. "Very soon!"

